      "start": {
        "desc": "Internal case DTB-BANK-24. Noah Patel forgot the PIN for the debit card ending 4561. Locate that ACTIVE card from authoritative account records, reset its PIN to 7515, enable recurring-payment blocking, freeze it, and commit. Do not touch pending lookalikes."
      },
      "case": {
        "desc": "Synthetic servicing packet DTB-BANK-24, opened 2026-07-03. The initial request intentionally supplies only the card's last four, not its internal ID. [Provenance: source facts are confidential internal synthetic TauBench fixtures; graph workflow is authored.]"
      },
      "user": {
        "desc": "Synthetic customer record. Name: Noah Patel. Customer ID: syn65hard_0018_users_03. Email: noah.patel+tau30018@example.test. Phone: 555-218-7271. Date of birth: 07/01/1998. Address: 118 Willow Street, Phoenix, AZ 85004."
      },
      "verification": {
        "desc": "Verification receipt DTB-BANK-24-V1: authenticated caller matched the synthetic customer record."
      },
      "account": {
        "desc": "Synthetic account record syn65hard_0018_accounts_01. Owner: syn65hard_0018_users_03. Class: checking. Status: OPEN. Opened: 07/02/2021. Product: Sky Blue Account."
      },
      "inventory": {
        "desc": "Authoritative inventory has one ACTIVE card and two PENDING cards. Use the status-filtered page that matches the request and inspect the matching record; the other status page is available for disambiguation but is not required when the ACTIVE match is unique."
